0:{"buildId":"-cWzmSOyU1muirH5dfsk2","data":[{"rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","main",null,{"id":"main-content","className":"min-h-screen bg-bg pt-24","children":[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Article\",\"headline\":\"Stop False A/B Test Wins to Build Truly Scalable Landing Pages\",\"description\":\"A ghost variant is when your control quietly breaks mid-test - a missing pixel, a truncated H1, a 404ing social proof block - and the \\\"winning\\\" variant wins by default. Here is how to detect it before you ship.\",\"author\":{\"@id\":\"https://nebulacomponents.com/#founder\"},\"datePublished\":\"2026-07-25\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-07-25\",\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https://nebulacomponents.com/#organization\"},\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://nebulacomponents.com/learning-centre/ghost-variant-ab-test\"},\"image\":\"https://nebulacomponents.com/opengraph-image\"}"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-14","children":[["$","$L2",null,{"href":"/learning-centre","className":"text-sm font-semibold text-accent hover:text-fg transition-colors","children":"← Learning Centre"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-8 rounded-md border border-border bg-bg-panel p-8 md:p-10","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"inline-block rounded-full bg-accent/10 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-accent","children":"Landing Page Leaks"}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-3xl font-bold leading-tight text-fg md:text-4xl","children":"Stop False A/B Test Wins to Build Truly Scalable Landing Pages"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-lg text-fg-muted leading-relaxed","children":"Your test platform declared a winner. Variant B beat the control by 14%. You ship it. What you never checked: variant A - your control - stopped rendering its social proof section on mobile three days into the test. The pixel misfired on Safari. The H1 truncated. Variant B didn't win. The control lost. That distinction matters, because now variant B is your new control, and you have no idea what you're actually measuring."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-stretch sm:items-center gap-3","children":[["$","$L2",null,{"href":"/audit?utm_source=learning-centre-ghost-variant-ab-test&utm_medium=hero-cta","className":"inline-flex min-h-[44px] items-center justify-center rounded bg-accent px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-bg transition-opacity hover:opacity-85","children":"Get your free audit →"}],["$","$L2",null,{"href":"/repair-sprint","className":"inline-flex min-h-[44px] items-center justify-center rounded border border-border px-5 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-fg-muted transition-colors hover:border-fg-muted hover:text-fg","children":"Explore $97 Repair Sprint"}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"mt-6 rounded-md border border-border bg-bg-panel p-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-xl font-bold text-fg","children":"What a Ghost Variant Is: The False Positive Win"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-fg-muted leading-relaxed","children":"A ghost variant is a control that has silently degraded during the test window. It is not visibly broken - nobody files a bug report, no monitoring alert fires - but one or more elements have failed in a way that suppresses conversions specifically for that variant. The challenger variant, running clean, appears to win. The test platform reports a statistically significant uplift. You ship."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-fg-muted leading-relaxed","children":"The term comes from the fact that the control looks fine at a glance. Open it in Chrome on a desktop. Everything renders. But on mobile Safari, the trust badge image returns a 404. On a slow 4G connection, the conversion tracking script loads after the user has already bounced. The ghost is invisible unless you specifically go looking for it."}],"$L3"]}],"$L4","$L5","$L6","$L7","$L8","$L9","$La"]}]]}],null,"$Lb"]}],"isPartial":"$@c","staleTime":"$d","varyParams":null},{"rsc":"$Le","isPartial":"$@f","staleTime":"$d","varyParams":null},{"rsc":"$L10","isPartial":"$@11","staleTime":"$d","varyParams":"$12"},{"rsc":"$L13","isPartial":"$@14","staleTime":"$d","varyParams":null}],"isUpgradeableISRFallback":false,"a":"$@15","rootVaryParams":null,"needsRuntimeRequest":"$@16"}
